{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Interior Tales",
    "steam_appid": 3222920,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3222920/extras/e58aa6088e3fbf9b258079af4a43ef9e.avif?t=1740597231\" width=600 height=201 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the role of an <strong>interior designer</strong> in a world in desperate need of creative touch. Bring your own and your clients' visions to life in this isometric and colorful simulation game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR REPUTATION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start from humble beginnings in <i>Central Point</i>, and work your way up to designing grand mansions in <i>Hillside</i>. The better you perform, the more opportunities will come your way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PLENTY OF UNLOCKABLES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each job offers something new to decorate with. Don't forget to explore the cities for hidden items and special decor pieces!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ICONIC ISOMETRIC ARTSTYLE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a 3D world in an isometric point of view, capturing the charm of classic games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RELAXING, YET REWARDING GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interior Tales offers a stress-free and forgiving gameplay experience while maintaining core simulation elements like an economy and progressive career development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3222920/extras/879dcc7439b6de4e8f9025bb6d43579d.poster.avif?t=1740597231\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3222920/extras/879dcc7439b6de4e8f9025bb6d43579d.webm?t=1740597231\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3222920/extras/879dcc7439b6de4e8f9025bb6d43579d.mp4?t=1740597231\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3222920/extras/e58aa6088e3fbf9b258079af4a43ef9e.avif?t=1740597231\" width=600 height=201 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the role of an <strong>interior designer</strong> in a world in desperate need of creative touch. Bring your own and your clients' visions to life in this isometric and colorful simulation game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR REPUTATION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start from humble beginnings in <i>Central Point</i>, and work your way up to designing grand mansions in <i>Hillside</i>. The better you perform, the more opportunities will come your way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PLENTY OF UNLOCKABLES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each job offers something new to decorate with. Don't forget to explore the cities for hidden items and special decor pieces!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ICONIC ISOMETRIC ARTSTYLE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a 3D world in an isometric point of view, capturing the charm of classic games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RELAXING, YET REWARDING GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interior Tales offers a stress-free and forgiving gameplay experience while maintaining core simulation elements like an economy and progressive career development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3222920/extras/879dcc7439b6de4e8f9025bb6d43579d.poster.avif?t=1740597231\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3222920/extras/879dcc7439b6de4e8f9025bb6d43579d.webm?t=1740597231\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3222920/extras/879dcc7439b6de4e8f9025bb6d43579d.mp4?t=1740597231\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Customize, renovate, and design in this isometric simulation game where creativity drives your success. Unlock new decor, build your reputation, and take on increasingly complex projects as you grow from small-scale spaces to luxurious mansions.",
